         0.0869148 +- 0.0000302 seconds time elapsed  ( +-  0.03% )

After:
          8,444.81 msec task-clock                       #   99.726 CPUs utilized               ( +-  2.90% )
                22      context-switches                 #    5.160 /sec                        ( +-  3.23% )
